            "notes": "**ROUND 1**\n\nThis round is the first of many, and I recommend that you buy:\n\n- [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \n- [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) \n- [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) \n\nThese items allow for uptime on healing output, as they both heal a bunch more with a lot more power and speed, while also allowing you to self heal a bunch with the reduced healing time to your own self.\n\n[Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) pushes that uptime a little bit further with two connecting threads of both damage and healing, so you can push the enemy a little bit more.\n\n**PLAYSTYLE**\n\nJust play like ordinary Mercy. Focus on staying alive and pushing healing and damage to the max!",
