            "notes": "**ROUND 3** \n\nThis is where things really start to pick up now. At this stage of the game, I am consistently doing over 10k healing. For this round, I will need you to buy:\n\n-  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) \n-  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) \n-  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) \n\n [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) is such an amazing build item, as that lovely 20% increased healing paired with the output from  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is a godsend. The items that you buy,  [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) and  [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) allows you to survive a little bit longer than normal and you can rez a little bit more consistently with the longer range, meaning you can slingshot with peace of mind (as long as you don't heal into a 1v5).\n\nThe optional items are there for survivability, or if you wish to make a little more of a twist and go for a little bit more damage. However, the cash that you earn from the healing alone is enough to fund the items!\n\n**PLAYSTYLE**\n\nPlay like normal!",
