            "notes": "**ROUND 4** \n\nIf you've made it this far, props to you!! Both teams are performing good! At this rate, 45k - 50k cash should not be a feat, and I believe in you to make this amount! I need you to purchase:\n\n-  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) \n\nReplacing  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) is a little bit risky, **HOWEVER**, I believe that the cooldowns for everything is necessary to pull of everything you want to more efficiently. If you want to keep  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) then you can, it will still be beneficial either way!!\n\n**PLAYSTYLE**\n\nPlay exactly how you have been playing all match up to this point, as your survivability is high enough at this point to survive a lot of pushes. I believe in you!",
