            "notes": "**ROUND 5**\n\nFinal round, you made it this far!!! I am incredibly proud! At this rate, 60k cash is ideal but if you've earnt more at this point well done!! I will need you to purchase:\n\n-   [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) \n-  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d)\n-  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) \n-  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) \n\n [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) will make your healing extraordinary! I rarely see my tank fall below 40% health the entire time I am healing them, which makes them near unkillable. Especially if you have a hero like  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) with his power  [To Me, My Friends!](item_9bd5bb9d-8026-4092-80c5-21e726c0969f) which heals even himself and allies around him! Your items will allow for that little bit of ability power and survivability for the best possible outcome!\n\n**PLAYSTYLE**\n\nHeal and poke, that is all. Your healing output will make your ult regenerate incredibly fast, almost extortionately. I hope you come out on top!",
